Type: project
Title: Licenses of shared OSF materials in psychology
Description: Packages used by the scripts, recorded in renv.lock. cowplot is
    not loaded by our scripts but by theme_dataviz.R in the original materials,
    which 02_analyse_licenses.R sources. jsonlite is only suggested by httr2
    but needed to read the OSF API responses.
